WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.354 --> 00:00:01.564
- Panic, panic panic...

00:00:01.564 --> 00:00:03.147
- Is this different than how you do it?

00:00:03.332 --> 00:00:03.966
- Yes!

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:05.771
(mysterious music)

00:00:08.539 --> 00:00:11.138
- Today, I am going to be
shaving Matt's beard off.

00:00:11.138 --> 00:00:12.270
- Yeah she is.

00:00:12.276 --> 00:00:13.865
- I don't like shaving my face because

00:00:13.865 --> 00:00:16.774
I have very sensitive skin
and I bleed very easily.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.099
- Good to know.

00:00:18.099 --> 00:00:18.827
- Okay.

00:00:18.827 --> 00:00:20.635
- It's your nerves that
make me nervous. - Really?

00:00:20.635 --> 00:00:21.979
- Otherwise, I'll not be nervous at all.

00:00:21.979 --> 00:00:23.609
- (gasp) You don't trust me?

00:00:23.609 --> 00:00:24.707
- No, I trust you.

00:00:24.707 --> 00:00:26.283
(mumbles) What I'm worried about

00:00:26.283 --> 00:00:27.619
is that you don't trust you.

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:29.018
- This could really hurt my face.

00:00:29.372 --> 00:00:31.700
- I know, I really really like his face.

00:00:31.743 --> 00:00:34.794
So I'm gonna really do my
best not scar it forever.

00:00:36.495 --> 00:00:38.382
(challenging music)

00:00:43.396 --> 00:00:44.752
- This is really cool!

00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:47.713
- It's like finger painting.

00:00:47.858 --> 00:00:50.455
Only, it might get a little bit lethal.

00:00:50.892 --> 00:00:51.919
- It's not gonna get lethal.

00:00:51.958 --> 00:00:53.337
- Your hair's so thick, I'm like here

00:00:53.337 --> 00:00:54.730
tilt your head. - [Matt] Okay.

00:00:54.882 --> 00:00:56.435
- I don't know if I'm hurting you or

00:00:56.435 --> 00:00:57.659
if it's like just like coming off?

00:00:57.697 --> 00:00:58.331
(groans)

00:00:58.341 --> 00:00:59.437
- Does that feel terrible?

00:00:59.437 --> 00:01:00.635
- I think you're going a little too hard.

00:01:00.644 --> 00:01:01.853
- [Taylor] Oh really? - [Mike] Yes

00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:02.484
- Oh (beep)

00:01:02.484 --> 00:01:03.634
- Is that hair under your ear?

00:01:03.634 --> 00:01:05.368
- Yes, it's everywhere.

00:01:06.068 --> 00:01:07.043
- (giggles)

00:01:07.043 --> 00:01:09.521
- Don't go across my neck like
you're slitting my throat!

00:01:09.783 --> 00:01:11.020
- (laughs)

00:01:11.489 --> 00:01:12.929
- Okay, now (mumbles)

00:01:12.929 --> 00:01:14.061
(laughter)

00:01:14.985 --> 00:01:17.277
- Oh, my vocal chords!

00:01:17.526 --> 00:01:19.715
- (giggles) I'm sorry.

00:01:20.565 --> 00:01:22.175
- (sighs) How do you...

00:01:22.175 --> 00:01:23.864
This is exhausting!

00:01:23.864 --> 00:01:25.734
- Why do you think I hate shaving?

00:01:25.772 --> 00:01:27.972
- Oh no! Oh no!

00:01:28.374 --> 00:01:29.249
