00:01:32.296 --> 00:01:33.247
- I'm so sorry

00:01:33.247 --> 00:01:34.553
Your Adam's Apple (mumbles)

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:35.467
- You cut me!

00:01:35.757 --> 00:01:36.683
- Okay.

00:01:37.933 --> 00:01:38.716
- (gasps)

00:01:38.716 --> 00:01:40.185
- What, what, what, what, what...

00:01:40.308 --> 00:01:41.485
What? - [Denisse] You're fine,

00:01:41.517 --> 00:01:42.989
I put it there and it made this noise.

00:01:42.989 --> 00:01:45.096
It sounded like I was
gonna tear your neck open.

00:01:47.232 --> 00:01:49.410
- You don't know what angle
you're doing (mumbles)

00:01:49.477 --> 00:01:50.663
You need to have a strategy.

00:01:50.663 --> 00:01:51.730
