lifetime achievement award,

00:02:05.197 --> 00:02:07.143
it's gonna be for shaving your face.

00:02:07.392 --> 00:02:09.743
That's how long it's taking.

00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:11.295
(razor scratching)

00:02:11.805 --> 00:02:13.143
- This is like the saddest razor.

00:02:13.175 --> 00:02:14.663
